    scene bg academy_dorm_exterior
    with fade
    show morrigan archive at sprite_right
    with dissolve
    "Alex helps her publish the buried archive safely and they open a tiny midnight study room together."
    morrigan "You chose the version of the truth that still lets people live with themselves."
